{"id":"n75297-1-9","stage":5,"title":"종사자 · 工作者","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75297-1-9-1","ko":"음악가나 화가들은 감수성이 남다르겠지?","zh":"音乐家或画家们的感知力应该特别敏锐吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음악가나","meaning":"音乐家","explanation":"음악가：音乐家；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"음악가","audio":"/audio/6edbf47c9289ff8198a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71117","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악가나","audio":"/audio/d0db923739c6cc7b1432.mp3"}},{"text":"화가들은","meaning":"画家","explanation":"화가：画家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73228","senseId":"1","lemma":"화가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화가들은","audio":"/audio/188b819f6a89f6bf40d0.mp3"}},{"text":"감수성이","meaning":"感性，感受力","explanation":"감수성：感性，感受力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감수성","audio":"/audio/e4e5890dfc05f492fd60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14758","senseId":"1","lemma":"감수성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감수성이","audio":"/audio/8fa84b97bfba1b9bef32.mp3"}},{"text":"남다르겠지?","meaning":"与众不同，独特","explanation":"남다르다：与众不同，独特；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"남다르다","audio":"/audio/00cfe3bc20f60eb1f4a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36949","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남다르겠지","audio":"/audio/9ff35cbcaff5e7e019e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6edbf47c9289ff81","term":"음악가","zh":"音乐家","audio":"/audio/6edbf47c9289ff8198a5.mp3","entryId":"71117","definition":"作曲家、演奏家、声乐家等专业从事音乐的人。","pronunciation":["으막까"]},{"id":"b04487b70213c84b","term":"화가","zh":"画家","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3","entryId":"73228","definition":"专业画画的人。","pronunciation":["화ː가"]},{"id":"e4e5890dfc05f492","term":"감수성","zh":"感性，感受力","audio":"/audio/e4e5890dfc05f492fd60.mp3","entryId":"14758","definition":"感觉外部刺激的性质或心理能力。","pronunciation":["감ː수썽"]},{"id":"00cfe3bc20f60eb1","term":"남다르다","zh":"与众不同，独特","audio":"/audio/00cfe3bc20f60eb1f4a5.mp3","entryId":"36949","definition":"跟一般人大不一样。","pronunciation":["남다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d301907b31f12f79077.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75297-1-9-2","ko":"응, 아무래도 예술계 종사자들은 우리랑 감수성이 다를 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，艺术界的从业者们的感知力确实应该和我们不一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"예술계","meaning":"艺术界","explanation":"예술계：艺术界","readings":[{"term":"예술계","audio":"/audio/96d6ce9eb144e986f0f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70567","senseId":"1","lemma":"예술계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예술계","audio":"/audio/96d6ce9eb144e986f0f8.mp3"}},{"text":"종사자들은","meaning":"工作者，从业人员","explanation":"종사자：工作者，从业人员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"종사자","audio":"/audio/72b8cbdf8773c47da3a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75297","senseId":"1","lemma":"종사자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종사자들은","audio":"/audio/008bc1a27b665772ac3d.mp3"}},{"text":"우리랑","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리랑","audio":"/audio/1d457559dd708f3a4954.mp3"}},{"text":"감수성이","meaning":"感性，感受力","explanation":"감수성：感性，感受力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감수성","audio":"/audio/e4e5890dfc05f492fd60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14758","senseId":"1","lemma":"감수성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감수성이","audio":"/audio/8fa84b97bfba1b9bef32.mp3"}},{"text":"다를","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다를","audio":"/audio/e38ce0cb45be4e57ff1c.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"96d6ce9eb144e986","term":"예술계","zh":"艺术界","audio":"/audio/96d6ce9eb144e986f0f8.mp3","entryId":"70567","definition":"以创作或表现艺术作品为职业的人们的社会；或指那领域。","pronunciation":["예ː술계","예ː술게"]},{"id":"72b8cbdf8773c47d","term":"종사자","zh":"工作者，从业人员","audio":"/audio/72b8cbdf8773c47da3a1.mp3","entryId":"75297","definition":"指有一定职业的工作人员